\section{Testing}
\label{sec:crossref-testing}

Tests are distributed through this chapter, each following the code it
verifies.  The Crossref client holds a shared cache and a rate-limit clock, so
before every test we reset both---otherwise a cached DOI from one test would
satisfy the next test's lookup without hitting our mock.

